{"id":"n40293-2-12","stage":1,"title":"등산 · 登山","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40293-2-12-1","ko":"산 정상까지는 아직 멀었어?","zh":"距离山顶还远吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"산","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정상까지는","meaning":"顶峰，山顶","explanation":"정상：顶峰，山顶；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"정상","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70879","senseId":"1","lemma":"정상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멀었어?","meaning":"远","explanation":"멀다：远；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"35688a85f0be1c63","term":"정상","zh":"顶峰，山顶","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3","entryId":"70879","definition":"山的最顶端。","pronunciation":["정상"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"远","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"两地之间的距离长。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b6341703262e989f6c2c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40293-2-12-2","ko":"등산 코스를 따라 가면 두 시간은 더 올라가야 해.","zh":"如果沿着登山路线